# Parrot Cage (Green Wing Macaw) from the Defias Pirates in the Deadmines.
# Sources: items.json (Defias Pirate, 3.5% per kill, pfQuest); the Deadmines is in Forever;
# Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338.

step The Deadmines: Defias Pirates
  tip The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. The Defias Pirates on and around the ship drop the macaw about 3.5% of the time in our data.
  goto 38.0,77.5 "The Deadmines portal, inside the Moonbrook mine"
  collect 8492 @38.0,77.5             -- Defias Pirates
